title: CacheFound
---
Neve: Recorded delivery. If you're hearing this, the cache likes you. Take the lot. I'm not coming back for it. #emotion:Playful
===
title: SelaCantorPreview
---
Sela: That's a navigation collar. It's holding the Cantor to the old chart, and it's losing. #emotion:Worried
Taren: Three links feeding a lock on the head. I can open those. #emotion:Determined
Sela: Look at the grooves in the walls. Same curve as the nursery. They follow its bend, not the collar. #emotion:Curious
Taren: The passage wants to turn. #emotion:Neutral
Sela: I'll mark the new line. You cut the links. Try not to enjoy it. #emotion:Playful
Taren: And we give it room when the lock opens. #emotion:Tender
===
